notes:        Original work for this repository, recoloured and re-drawn for VideoBox: the panel carries the Turtle Box turtle mark (a brand mark under docs/brand/LICENSE-brand.txt, not MIT OR Apache-2.0). Text is outlined Inter / JetBrains Mono glyph paths. Used for the Finder window of the macOS DMG; packaging/macos/dmg/generate.py renders it to background.tiff. See packaging/macos/dmg/README.md.
